like to obtain a basic understanding of crypto currency.The course will cover the history of virtual currencies and explain how they work. We will review some of the legal issues involved with virtual currencies. The course will cover the advantages and disadvantages of using virtual currencies. We will review the IRS rules for tracking and reporting crypto currency transactions for tax purposes.Define cryptocurrencyRecognize the tax implications of using or investing in cryptocurrencyIdentify how the IRS defines virtual currencyIdentify advantages and disadvantages to using cryptocurrencyDescribe the first cyptopcurrency and when it was created and releasedDifferentiate correct statements regarding the history of BitcoinRecognize case studies and how they could apply to your clientsDifferentiate correct statements with respect to virtual currencies and taxesIdentify most commonly used currencies',NULL,'Outline'),(34,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(35,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to find your login details, you can reset 