','What is a great way to spend cash, then put it right back into your pocket? Spend it on wages, then claim the employee retention credit (ERC). It’s a great deal and keeps on getting better. You just have to know how to play the game. And, the rules of the game keep getting better. The American Rescue Plan Act (ARPA) ratchets up the amount you can grab back. It’s ridiculously lucrative.An employer with 10 employees making $40,000 each for each 2020 and 2021 may claim an ERC of up to $50,000 for 2020 and a up to a whopping $280,000 for 2021.This is the biggest issue tax practitioners face this tax season. Let’s make sure we don’t leave money on the table.Claiming ERC along side PPP forgiveness – Strategies and mechanicsExtension of ERC through end of 2021– But with new rulesExactly who qualifies (and does not) for ERC anyway?ARPA opens up new opportunity for start up businessesPayroll tax credit / income tax interaction - Timing, timing, timingPractical dos and donts - Missteps and errors to avoid',NULL,'Outline'),(46,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(47,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details tha