PA”). ARPA made significant changes to the Internal Revenue Code and essentially created a new stimulus package. The COVID-19 crisis, financial fluctuations, the new Biden administration and the new makeup of Congress add to the burden of your practice during this tax season. This course will educate you in how ARPA will affect your clients 2021.A brief history of COVID-19 relief legislationARPA program fundingVarious Unemployment Benefit IssuesExtension of Pandemic Unemployment Assistance (PUA)Extension of Federal Unemployment Compensation (FPUC)Extension of Pandemic Emergency Unemployment Compensation (PEUC)Current taxable issuesPPP modificationsEIDL modificationsRestaurant Revitalization Grants – program and issuesThe third round of recovery rebates (Economic Impact Payments)Changes in the Child Tax CreditExpansion of the Earned Income Tax CreditExpansion of the Dependent Care Credit and Dependent Care AssistanceExpansion and extension ot the FFCRAExtension of the Employee Retention CreditAffordable Care Act changes',NULL,'Outline'),(86,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(87,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal