still have problems logging in, please email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.comDoes this course count towards CLE?Unfortunately, our courses do not provide CLE credits…yet!Do you sell through other websites?We currently do not sell our courses on other third party platforms. However, we are always looking to provide our courses to our students and therefore partnerships will be announced to all learners as we enter into these.',NULL,'Other'),(136,'Credit & Other Info','Session Duration: 2 HoursSession Prerequisites and preparation: NoneSession learning level: IntroductoryDelivery method: Group Internet BasedNASBA and IRS Credits: 2 Tax HoursIRS CE Provider #: QQTMINASBA Sponsor #: 143337IRS Course ID: QQTMI-T-00103-20-O',NULL,'Credits'),(137,'Outline','What’s new in late 2021 re: Covid relief for business? Tons. The game has changed a whole lot in a big hurry in the past few weeks. For preparing (or amending) 2020, 2021 and 2022 income tax returns reporting PPP forgiveness and spending, whole new worlds have opened up. For part of the employee retention credit (ERC), both Congress and IRS have slammed the door on our fingers (or at least attempted to)Both new opportunities and stumbling blocks abound. How do we respond?IRS blows open PPP timing grabRev. Procs. 2021-48, -49 and -50 open amended return floodgatesNOL carrybacks for cash, anyone?When is best time to file for PPP Draw 2 forgiveness? It really does matterCongress rips away part of ERC, but leaves more on the table than you thinkStatus of ERC eligibility for Corp shareholder’s wagesIRS launches ERC audit program – America in the crosshairsPlanning, planning, planning and reporting choices, choices, choicesNew IRS Update: Direct new guidance from IRS to avoid failure to deposit penalties re: 4Q ERC that Congress ripped out from under us. ',NULL,'Outline'),(138,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in 