 Resolutions Identify Barriers to Discharging Taxes in Bankruptcy Understand Best Practices For Lien Removal or Subordination Minimize Tax Penalties For Your ClientsAgenda Review of IRS Transcripts for Due Diligence Evaluation of Responsible Person Liability for Sales and Payroll Taxes Best Practices for Discharging Taxes in Bankruptcy Including Late Filed ReturnsOverview of Various Tax Resolution Options, including Collection Due Process Hearings, Innocent Spouse Claims, Offers in Compromise, and Installment Agreements and Their Potential Impact On Subsequent Bankruptcy Discharge Challenging Tax Liens and Review of Technical Issues Involving Priority and Divestment of Liens. Practical Considerations for Discharging Liens, Subordination of Liens, and Certificate of Non-Attachment Requesting Penalty Abatement and Discharging Penalties in Bankruptcy',NULL,'Outline'),(182,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(183,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to find your login details, you can reset your password. We also email certificates to all