unding Our Priorities”. It includes proposed international, corporate, individual and retirement tax “reforms”. This course will provide you with a complete understanding of this proposal as well as integrated planning ideas that will direct your client’s year-end needs.The materials will include all updates in existence at the time of the lecture. In addition, we will opine on the probability of this proposal passing as law.Increase in corporate tax rateIncrease in top marginal income tax rateIncrease in capital gains rateChanges in Net Investment Income Tax rate to trade or business income of certain high-income individualsNew QBI limitations for IRC §199ALimitation on excess business lossesSurcharge on high-income individuals, trusts, and estatesElimination of higher unified creditIncrease in limitation of IRC §2032A special use valuationGrantor Trust rule changesReduction in valuation discountsRetirement plan contribution limitations for high-income taxpayersRMD increase for high-income taxpayersElimination of “back-door IRAsVarious IRA changesMany additional miscellaneous changesYear-end estate and gift planning ideasYear-end gifting ideasCharitable transaction planningRoth conversion ideas',NULL,'Outline'),(218,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(219,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to find your login details, you can reset your password. We also email certificates to all learners after each course. Check your inbox (incl. spam folder). If something seems amiss, and neither options are available, please email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.comI couldn’t attend, can you send me the recording?24 hours after an event has finished, all learners receive a copy of the recording (without CPE Credits). Please check your inbox (and your spam folders) to ensure that you have received the recording.Can I mail you a cheque as payment?For group orders we do allow cheque orders as long as we are set up as a preferred vendor with your organization. We only accept cheques for orders valued over $1000.I need a refund. What are my options?We offer refunds under the following circumstances:Cancelling attendance 24 hours before the event.Not satisfied with our event/recording: If you are not happy with our event we will gladly issue a refund. All we ask is that you provide us with detailed feedback. We know we are not perfect!If your situation does not fall in the above two options, email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.com or contact us via the chat bot on our website to further discuss your situation with us.My discount code didn’t work!Make sure that there are no spaces between the letters and numbers, and that your discount code does not have an expiration date.Still have issues? We have a handy chat bot on our website that can help you with this during office hours. If you require assistance outside of office hours, you can email your query to cpe@cpewarehouse.comI can’t attend the event – How do I cancel my registration?Cancellations are available within 24 hours before an event begins. After this point, cancellation is no longer possible. Just email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.com and we will take it from there.I don’t remember my password!Please request a password re-set via our website, on the login page. Should you still have problems logging in, please email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.comDoes this course count towards CLE?Unfortunately, our courses do not provide CLE credits…yet!Do you sell through other websites?We currently do not sell our courses on other third party platforms. However, we are always looking to provide our courses to our students and therefore partnerships will be announced to all learners as we enter into these.',NULL,'Other'),(220,'Credit & Other Info','Session Duration: 2 HoursSession Prerequisites and preparation: NoneSession learning level: IntroductoryDelivery method: Group Internet BasedNASBA and IRS Credits: 2 Tax HoursIRS CE Provider #: QQTMINASBA Sponsor #: 143337IRS Course ID: QQTMI-T-00151-21-O',NULL,'Credits'),(221,'Outline','Recent surveys indicate over half of tax practitioners have not yet filed an Employee Retention Credit (ERC) claim on Form 941. Over 75% have not yet filed a retroactive claim on Form 941-X. What’s the holdup? For many, it’s lack of command and working knowledge of the ERC rules. Another tricky part is how ERC, in competition for the same wages, interplays with ERC. Others do not fully appreciate the opportunities for ERC refunds. Others are stumbling on frustrating new IRS guidance.In this course, we’ll sort it all out for you and put you in command of how to push it all through with confidence and maximize both PPP forgiveness and ERC.C or S Corp shareholders (and their relatives) wages for ERC – Who’s in, who’s out? IRS reverses course in Notice 2021-49Detailed chart of exactly which payroll costs qualify for PPP vs. ERCExactly how drop in gross receipts tests met (including safe harbors)Scenarios qualifying for partial suspension/more than a nominal portionDoes teleworking spoil the pie for partial suspension?What is a “recovery startup business” under ARPA? Don’t miss it!Aggregation rules - Examples of parent sub, brother/sister, combined or affiliated service groupsComputational examples shown on Forms 941 and 941-XDetermining who is small vs. large employer – This one may shock youAdvantages of cutting off PPP covered period shortCurrent odds of Congressional meddling',NULL,'Outline'),(222,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(223,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to find your login details, you can reset your password. We also email certificates to all learners after each course. Check your inbox (incl. spam folder). If something seems amiss, and neither options are available, please email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.comI couldn’t attend, can you send me the recording?24 hours after an event has finished, all learners receive a copy of the recording (without CPE Credits). Please check your inbox (and your spam folders) to ensure that you have received the recording.Can I mail you a cheque as payment?For group orders we do allow cheque orders as long 