er #: QQTMINASBA Sponsor #: 143337IRS Course ID: QQTMI-U-00150-21-O',NULL,'Credits'),(225,'Outline','Tax compliance issues in estate and gift taxation are sometimes confusing to practitioners because many lack experiences in this area. This course provides the practitioner with a “hands-on” understanding as to how to prepare both the Federal Form 706 (Estate Tax return) and the Federal Form 709 (Gift Tax return). The participants will be shown how to properly prepare these returns “line-by-line”. Mastering this course will allow the practitioner to gain confidence in preparing these difficult tax returns.HighlightsOverview of the Federal Form 706Overview of the Federal Form 709How to prepare a federal estate tax return (Form 706)How to prepare a federal gift tax return (Form 709)How to comply with “Portability”Coordination of the various issues involved in the preparation of the decedent’s final federal income tax return (Form 1040)',NULL,'Outline'),(226,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(227,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to 