line','Treasury and SBA keeping dropping game changing rules on PPP forgiveness. And, it never seems to end. The changes matter more than a little. And, they keep coming. The question becomes: How does a PPP borrower aim at the PPP moving target and actually hit it to achieve forgiveness? The answer lies in not only keeping up with the changes, but also in developing a sense of context and thinking process.ObjectiveTo update and increase competence toward hitting the PPP forgiveness markCourse OutlineBrand spanking new SBA Form 3508S – What it is, what’s not, when to useNew PPP rules restricting the future of a business – Jumping never-seen-before hoopsDeductibility of expenses funded by PPP loanAll that’s newAutomatic forgiveness – There’s no such thing – Nor will there beSpecifics of looming Congressional meddling08/24/20 game changing borrower friendly IFR (regs) re: owner employees08/24/20 harsh new IFR limits re: rentals, self-rentals and mortgage interest08/11/20 and 08/04/20 game changer FAQs',NULL,'Outline'),(342,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(343,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details 