n this area. This course provides you with a practical understanding of the issues involved in preparing the federal estate tax return, Form 706; and the federal gift tax return, Form 709.How to prepare a federal estate tax return (Form 706) and federal gift tax return (Form 709)How to comply with “Portability”Various postmortem estate planning issues involved in the preparation of the above-mentioned tax returnsAgendaUnderstand the Internal Revenue Code sections dealing with Forms 706 and 709Describe what constitutes a gross estateDescribe what constitutes deductionsDescribe what constitutes an incomplete giftIdentify the basic issues as they relate to tax compliance',NULL,'Outline'),(426,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(427,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to find your login details, you can reset your password. We also email certificates to all learners after each course. Check your inbox (incl. spam folder). If something seems amiss, and neither options are available, please email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.comI couldn’t atten