Provider #: QQTMINASBA Sponsor #: 143337IRS Course ID: QQTMI-U-00036-19-O',NULL,'Credits'),(501,'Outline','Tax compliance issues for fiduciary entities are sometimes confusing to practitioners due to the fact that many lack experience in this area. This course is a follow-up to our basic course on 1041 preparation/compliance.The objective of this course is to provide advanced compliance guidance to preparing the U.S. Income Tax Return for Estates and Trusts (Form 1041). In our basic course, we instruct the practitioners as to how entities work, how to read documents, and how to begin the compliance issues regarding this form.  In this class, we examine the advanced issues of compliance regarding the U.S. Income Tax Return for Estates and Trusts (Form 1041).Charitable and split-interest trust compliance issues Irrevocable Grantor Trust issues IRC §645 election issues Understanding the basics of Subchapter J of the Internal Revenue CodeSchedule A (Charitable Deduction) compliance issuesSchedule B (Income Distribution Deduction) compliance issues Advanced Distributable Net Income (DNI) issues',NULL,'Outline'),(502,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(503,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where cer