 all learners as we enter into these.',NULL,'Other'),(628,'Credit & Other Info','Session Duration: 2 HoursSession Prerequisites and preparation: NoneSession learning level: IntroductoryDelivery method: Group Internet BasedNASBA and IRS Credits: 2 Tax HoursIRS CE Provider #: QQTMINASBA Sponsor #: 143337IRS Course ID: QQTMI-T-00176-22-O',NULL,'Credits'),(629,'Outline','With another tax season in the books, this webinar will look at increasing revenues outside of tax season with the Employee Retention Credit (ERC). The Employee Retention Credit came about during COVID in the CARES Act and was later expanded to allow businesses who claimed the PPP to also claim this credit. This credit can pay up to 70% of a client’s payroll during tax years 2020-2021.ObjectiveSince this credit is so taxpayer friendly, it will be under heavy IRS scrutiny. This webinar will look at all the intricate rules around the credit, including what you need to do to make sure your client’s credit is audit proof. We will look at proper documentation along with the more complex situations that occur with the credit.Course OutlineOverview of the Employee Retention CreditInteraction of the ERC and the PPPQualifying for the ERCCalculating and Applying for the ERCProper documentation for the ERCMarketing your ERC practiceBilling procedures for the ERCExamples and case studies',NULL,'Outline'),(630,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase