ncyUnderstanding the term “blockchain”Various types of cryptocurrenciesWhy cryptocurrency is popularInvestment attributes of cryptocurrencyTax aspects of cryptocurrencyPosition of the Internal Revenue ServiceUnderstanding Notice 2014-21 (IRS Virtual Currency Guidance)Understanding Notice 2014-21 FAQsCompliance issuesCharitable issuesInternal Revenue Service enforcementWe will update any potential new legislation in the horizon including the 68 page Lummis-Gillibrand Bill.',NULL,'Outline'),(638,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(639,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to find your login details, you can reset your password. We also email certificates to all learners after each course. Check your inbox (incl. spam folder). If something seems amiss, and neither options are available, please email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.comI couldn’t attend, can you send me the recording?24 hours after an event has finished, all learners receive a copy of the recording (without CPE Credits). Please check your inbox (and your spam folders) to ensure tha