gh as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(695,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to find your login details, you can reset your password. We also email certificates to all learners after each course. Check your inbox (incl. spam folder). If something seems amiss, and neither options are available, please email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.comI couldn’t attend, can you send me the recording?24 hours after an event has finished, all learners receive a copy of the recording (without CPE Credits). Please check your inbox (and your spam folders) to ensure that you have received the recording.Can I mail you a cheque as payment?For group orders we do allow cheque orders as long as we are set up as a preferred vendor with your organization. We only accept cheques for orders valued over $1000.I need a refund. What are my options?We offer refunds under the following circumstances:Cancelling attendance 24 hours before the event.Not satisfied with our event/recording: If you are not happy with our event we will gladly issue a refund. All we ask is that you provide us with detailed feedback. We know we are not perfect!If your situation does not fall in the above two options, email us at cpe@cpewarehouse.com or contact us via the chat bot on our website to further discuss your situation with us.My discount code didn’t work!Make sure that