ming to benefit both your clients and your practice. One ancillary area that you could add to your practice would be Notary and Notary-related services. This course will show you, the Enrolled Agent, how to best add and integrate this valuable profit center to your practice.To provide an overview and guide to adding Notary and Notary-related services to the practice of an Enrolled AgentHighlightsWhat are the functions of a NotaryHow Notary functions integrate with the practice of an Enrolled AgentSteps to become a NotaryUnderstanding the Revised Uniform Law on Notarial Acts (“RULONA”)Understanding what a Notary should not notarizeHow to establish and operate a Notary businessThe “ins and outs” of general notarization',NULL,'Outline'),(714,'GiveAway','We donate $1 to the Alzheimers Foundation of America every time you buy a course from us.Alzheimers Disease is the 6th leading cause of death in the United States.In 2019, Alzheimers and other dementias will cost the nation $290 billion. By 2050 these costs could rise as high as $1.1 trillion.5.8 million Americans are living with Alzheimers. This number is projected to grow to nearly 14 million by 2050.We dont want to sit around doing nothing. Therefore, apart from serving our customers, we want to be a part of the next breakthrough in Alzheimers treatment.CPE Warehouse donates $1 of every purchase you make to the Alzheimers Foundation of America.(For more information visit www.alzfdn.org/)',NULL,'GivingBack'),(715,'FAQ','I can’t find my CPE Certificate. What should I do?Every learner has access to their learners portal, via our website, where certificates are kept for ease of access. Please log into the learners portal with the details that were provided to you upon registration. If you are not able to find your login details, you can reset your password. We also email certificates to all learners after each course. Check your inbox (incl. spam folder). If something seems amiss, and neither options are available, pleas