:00.000000',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,1,'Hours',NULL,1,'cme-eavenue-test-course-08-28',NULL,'2','2023-08-28 10:52:44.155000','2025-06-25 14:44:45.781000','2023-08-28 10:53:12.945000',2,2,'6705679958712029791',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(326,'Coding and Billing Updates for Physician Assistants','<p>This timely webinar will give you the valuable updates in Guidelines for your Physician Assistant for 2024 but will also review the other methods of billing for their services. &nbsp;This will ensure that your practice can have compliant documentation, coding and billing of your Physician Assistant’s services.</p>',0.00,3.00,'2025-04-01 17:00:00.000000','2025-04-01 20:00:00.000000',NULL,NULL,'Test',1,NULL,1,'Hours',NULL,1,'coding-and-billing-updates-for-physician-assistants',NULL,'3','2024-03-21 11:53:18.810000','2025-06-25 18:05:20.193000','2024-03-21 11:54:34.480000',2,2,'87995493871',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' NA'),(327,'Deconstructing Physician Supervision For Provider Based Clinics','<p>In this webinar, our expert speaker will discuss the physician supervision requirements for diagnostic services and therapeutic services, the rules for on-campus vs. off-campus departments as well as the different types of physician supervision – general, direct, and personal required for each setting.</p>',199.00,2.00,'2024-09-11 18:00:00.000000','2024-09-11 20:00:00.000000',NULL,NULL,'Tax-Season',1,NULL,1,'Hours',NULL,1,'deconstructing-physician-supervision-for-provider-based-clinics',NULL,'2','2024-03-21 12:10:29.691000','2025-06-03 11:54:39.328000','2024-03-21 12:10:32.696000',2,2,'88970986561',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' NA'),(328,'Hospital EM Services Updates','<p>Attendees will have a clear understanding of how to apply not only the 2023 guidelines, but the updates for 2024. &nbsp;This will allow the correct choosing and reporting of Evaluation and Management level of service for visits performed in the hospital and nursing home settings.</p>',199.00,2.00,'2024-09-25 17:00:00.000000','2024-09-25 19:00:00.000000',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,1,'Hours',NULL,1,'hospital-em-services-updates',NULL,'2','2024-03-21 12:14:59.597000','2025-06-02 20:51:52.954000','2024-03-21 12:15:08.807000',2,2,'87325878383',NULL,'Accounting',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' NA'),(329,'Test','<p>Testing</p>',1.00,2.00,'2025-09-24 18:30:00.000000','2025-09-24 20:30:00.000000',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,1,'Hours',NULL,1,'test',NULL,'2','2025-09-18 07:47:04.621000','2025-09-18 07:48:07.514000','2025-09-18 07:48:07.506000',2,2,'89597699570',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(330,'CME Test_01-092025','<p>CME Test_01-092025</p>',1.00,2.00,'2025-09-30 16:00:00.000000','2025-09-30 18:00:00.000000',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,1,'Hours',NULL,1,'cme-test-01-092025',NULL,NULL,'2025-09-20 08:55:26.176000','2025-09-22 11:35:36.437000','2025-09-20 08:55:54.607000',2,2,'81381203079',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' 2 NASBA and IRS (Taxes)');
